{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30246","headline":"元日楼前观仗 一 · 薛逢","name":"元日楼前观仗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千门曙色鏁寒梅，五夜疎钟晓箭催。\n宝马占堤朝阙去，香车争路进名来。\n天临玉几班初合，日照金鸡仗欲回。\n更傍紫微瞻北斗，上林佳气满楼台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}